demoapiscalargalaxy\-completion \- print a shell completion script
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B demoapiscalargalaxy completion
\fIshell\fR
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Prints a completion script for the named shell to standard output. The script is generated from the same command table demoapiscalargalaxy itself is built from, so it always describes this version's commands and flags. Supported shells are bash, zsh, and fish.
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
